# Task Management Application

A simple and user-friendly Task Management Application designed to help users organize and manage their daily tasks efficiently.

## Features

- Add new tasks
- Mark tasks as completed
- Delete tasks
- Simple and responsive user interface
- Easy task management

## Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Python
- Flask

## How It Was Created

The frontend was designed using HTML and CSS.
JavaScript was used to add interactive functionality.
The backend was developed using Python and Flask.

The project was developed and tested using Visual Studio Code.
Git and GitHub were used for version control and project hosting.

## How to Run the Project

1. Download or clone the repository.
2. Open the project folder in Visual Studio Code.
3. Install the required dependencies.
4. Run the Flask application.
5. Open the application in a web browser.

## Project Purpose

This project was developed as part of an internship task at Thiranex to demonstrate practical skills in web development, backend programming, and project management.
